OL,3,GNEWSAHull City player crashes spark
OL,4,Aroad review call
OL,5,
OL,6,FA councillor is calling for an urgent
OL,7,Fsafety review of a section of road near
OL,8,FHull City's training ground after two
OL,9,Fcrashes in three weeks involving the
OL,10,Fclub's players.
OL,12,FLucas Gourna-Douath, 23, crashed on
OL,13,FMillhouse Woods Lane in Cottingham,
OL,14,FEast Yorkshire, on Thursday. Sorba
OL,15,FThomas had previously crashed his car
OL,16,Fon the same road in September.
OL,18,FCouncillor Phil Redshaw said the
OL,19,Fincidents should serve as a "wake-up
OL,20,Fcall". He said: "We've got to recognise
OL,21,Fthat something has to be done."
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
